      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">At the height of your power, the night sky seems to unveil a new power within you. While you share the same sky at a planetary range you always know the direction of, the distance from and any conditions affecting up to five allies you designate each day, and another five creatures whom you have a strong, friendly connection to. Under a full or new moon, you can cast Dream Council as an innate spell at 8th rank once per day.</span></p>"
